      "title": "Flawless Finish Brush Set",
      "subtitle": "Achieve a flawless, airbrushed complexion with the Flawless Finish Brush Set by Sigma Beauty. This duo features two versatile Kabuki brushes designed to effortlessly apply and blend liquid, cream, and powder products for a smooth, radiant finish. Perfect for foundation, setting powder, or finishing touches, these brushes deliver professional results with every use. \n\nHOW TO USE \nUse the 4DHD™ Kabuki Brush to apply and blend foundation or setting powder for full, even coverage with a natural finish. Follow with the F82 Round Kabuki™ Brush to buff and perfect your makeup, ensuring a seamless, streak-free look. \n\nDETAILS \nBrushes Included: \n4DHD™ Kabuki Brush\nF82 Round Kabuki™ Brush\n\nTECHNOLOGY \nHIGHEST-QUALITY FIBERS: \nExclusive synthetic antimicrobial fibers to protect skin\nEngineered to better hold, apply + blend product\n\nFERRULES WITH UNMATCHED STRENGTH: \nDurable + corrosion-resistant SigmaAlloy™\nPrecious metal plating for shine + strength\nExclusive, patented interlocking technology\nDouble-threaded engineering\n\nSLEEK, DURABLE HANDLES: \nSolid polymer-based handles are waterproof + unbreakable\nOutlasts all product formulas + frequent brush care\n\nUS Patent D801,058\nUS Patent D718,060\nZL 201730430935.8\nZL 201730430472.5\nAdditional Patents Pending\n\nFor more information, visit our Patents page .",
