      "publish_state": "public",
      "title": "Sigma Signature Set",
      "subtitle": "Discover the ultimate multitasking brush set with the Sigma Signature Set – a curated collection of must-haves for flawless application from face to eyes. Featuring three of Sigma Beauty’s best-selling brushes and the innovative Sigma Switch, this set makes makeup application and brush cleaning effortless. Perfect for both beginners and pros, the Signature Set gives you the tools to blend, buff, and switch shades without missing a beat.\n\nHOW TO USE \nStart by applying your foundation with the F80 Flat Kabuki™ Brush using circular motions for a smooth, even base. Use the F79 Concealer Blend Kabuki™ Brush to seamlessly blend concealer under the eyes or around the nose. Define and blend eyeshadow with the E25 Blending Brush for a flawless eye look. Between shades or products, gently sweep your brush across the Sigma ® Switch to remove pigment instantly—no water or cleanser needed. \n\nDETAILS \nProducts Included: \n\nF80 Flat Kabuki™ Brush\n\nF79 Concealer Blend Kabuki™ Brush\n\nE25 Blending Brush\n\nSigma ® Switch \n\nTECHNOLOGY \nHIGHEST-QUALITY FIBERS: \nExclusive synthetic antimicrobial fibers\nEngineered to better hold, apply + blend products\n\nFERRULES WITH UNMATCHED STRENGTH: \nDurable + corrosion-resistant SigmaAlloy™\nPrecious metal plating for shine + strength\nExclusive, patented interlocking technology\nDouble-threaded engineering\n\nSLEEK, DURABLE HANDLES: \nSolid polymer-based handles are waterproof\nOutlasts all product formulas + frequent brush care \n\n \n\nFormulated without: Latex, BPA, Lead\nNon-toxic material\nMade of high-grade silicone \n\n \n\nUS Patent No. D862,901 \n\nUS Patent No. 9,888,764\nUS Patent No. 9,474,361\nEU Registered Design 005782018-0001 \n\nEuropean Patent No. 3009032\nZL 201830331890.3 \nAustralian Patent No. 2015221549 \nAdditional Patents Pending \n\nFor more information, visit our Patents page .",
